<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        Showcase demo data: ONE finished hardware survey of a small, invented
        site, so the "Import from Hardware" list is not empty on a demo
        database and every tab shows what a real survey tells the operator.

        The survey is 'done' on purpose: the scheduled worker only picks up
        surveys in a working state, so a finished one is inert and never tries
        to reach the (non-existent) module below. Every address and number is
        fabricated; the raw replies were built from the documented reply
        layouts, not copied from any installation.

        noupdate="1": the survey is a historical record; an operator may delete
        it once they have seen it.
    -->
